  <name>Zinc</name>
  <summary>A terminal written in Zig</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Zinc is an ultra-lightweight Wayland-native terminal emulator written
      in pure Zig. It pairs a fast software renderer with FreeType text,
      kitty graphics, smooth scrolling, and a Ghostty-style config file —
      without a GPU or toolkit dependency.
    </p>
  </description>
